# keep image contexts small and hermetic (mirrors .gitignore where it matters)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/data
**/.data
.git
.arena
docs
*.md
!backend/requirements*.txt

# --- secrets and local state must never enter an image layer ---
# A stray backend/.env (real keys) or a *.patch file would otherwise be baked
# into the image by `COPY . .`. The app reads configuration from the container
# environment, so nothing here is needed at build or run time.
.env
.env.*
*.patch
*.pem
*.key
secret.key
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db
logs/
